  "body": "There was discussion in #483 about adding items specific to serverless functions and a small addition was made here: https://github.com/OWASP/ASVS/commit/c466ce918e401fac90e5e59baf97860e7155387c\r\n\r\nThe relevant projects appear inactive and not to contain issues that would be in scope for ASVS which are specific to serverless/cloud native apps:\r\n* https://owasp.org/www-project-cloud-native-application-security-top-10/\r\n* https://owasp.org/www-project-serverless-top-10/\r\n\r\nI am therefore proposing to remove these specific references in ASVS",
